<title>USA: Prince George's Cty, Md., won by Legg Mason.</title>
<headline>Prince George's Cty, Md., won by Legg Mason.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Legg Mason Wood Walker said it won $5.650 million of Prince George's Cty, Md., general obligation stormwater management bonds, Series 1997 B, with a true interest cost of 5.3228 percent.</p>
